    "Award boundaries 1997–2026 were cross-checked against the UKMT awards page. Follow-on thresholds are conditional on school year and other competition eligibility rules.",
    "Free full paper and short-solution links cover 1999–2026. Extended solutions cover 2011–2026. Official UKMT-hosted files are used for 2015 onward; older UKMT documents are hosted by MyMathsCloud. No paper links were located for 1997–1998, whose verified award boundaries remain listed.",
    "The UKMT 2025 extended-solutions filename contains 2024, but its first page explicitly says 29 January 2025 and the document is the 2025 solutions.",
    "Mathsaurus reports a separate China/ASEEDER 2025 paper. No independently verified direct paper link was located for that variant, so it is not mixed with the main paper.",
    "Links point to the source publishers; no UKMT papers or solution text are republished.",
    "Dr Frost has an indexed IMC 2002 interactive worksheet at https://www.drfrost.org/worksheets.php?wid=43, but the current web open returned an empty JavaScript shell, so it has not been used as a direct paper link.",
    "All 36 direct official PDF links (2015–2026) were opened successfully through web verification on 2026-09-10; each returned a parsed PDF. See imc-pdf-validation.json for the validation record.",
    "All 36 older MyMathsCloud PDF links were opened and verified as PDFs on 2026-09-10. See imc-mmc-verified.json. Three initial transient web failures succeeded on one retry."
